		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Strange mer-thing. Upper half of a monkey, lower half of a carp. If slain, it animates as undead. Flesh is toxic.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 5, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +0 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Poison Flesh</strong>. If eaten, CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per hour; ends on success. Die at 0 CON, animate as zombie at midnight.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undeath</strong>. If slain, animates as undead ningyo at midnight.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
